#: ../../source/classes/class_audioimporterfmod.rst:16 0c4b71d8e91041eabd15429d81aff68f
msgid "Editor import plugin for importing audio files as FMOD audio streams."
msgstr "将音频文件导入为 FMOD 音频流的编辑器导入插件。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_audioimporterfmod.rst:21 17c25af92fbe4fc7b1bf347de7738241
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_audioimporterfmod.rst:23 6c19b04e60ee492aa694ec451ca0f9ee
msgid ""
"AudioImporterFmod is an editor plugin that handles importing audio files into "
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` resources. It integrates with Godot's import system"
" to provide seamless audio asset management."
msgstr ""
"AudioImporterFmod 将音频文件导入为    :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`    资源，并接入 Godot "
"的资源导入流程。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_audioimporterfmod.rst:25 4cd348a9ec2d482d98e53be68796e5da
msgid ""
"Supported formats include common audio types like MP3, WAV, OGG, FLAC, and others supported by "
"FMOD."
msgstr "支持 MP3、WAV、OGG、FLAC 等常见格式，以及 FMOD 支持的其他音频格式。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_audioimporterfmod.rst:27 06df4d90354a43a6af2dffd793aa8982
msgid ""
"The importer processes audio files during project import, creating optimized "
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` resources that can be used with "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>` and "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`."
msgstr ""
"导入器在项目导入时处理音频文件，生成供    :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>`    和    "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`    使用的    "
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`    资源。"
